Update the canonical Data Workbench issue (`rrahul0904/open-source-ai-workbench#16`) with this donor delta, then implement the **share-lease + bounded query + mask-policy** slice on the existing Data Workbench implementation line before enabling any agent mutation path. Mutation proposals come only after the read/masking boundary passes adversarial tests and exact-head CI.

